commit message:
1 - allowing ... to be passed to threshold contour;
2 - allowing control of size of label text;
3 - return character code for tex table invisibly.

To CRAN:
- removed "this package" from description;
- link for reference in description;
- removed unexplained acronyms in description;
- add "return" in manual to add_bound_to_contour (NULL);
- verbose option for ovb_minimal_reporting;
- on.exit(par(oldpar)) in ovb_contour_plot

feat: add polarized photon simulation

Add a new vector in kernel (iquv, stokes parameter) to describe
polarization status;
Add rejection method to perform scattering simulation (theta, phi);
Add code to update stokes vector after scattering event.

feat: support polarized MC in command line (JSON)

Allow mcx_loadjson function to parse input parameters for
polarized light simulation;
Move preprocessing of polarized MC input data to the front of
mcx_preprocess function to consider different dx,dy,dz(unitinmm);

Split maths.py

New files:
dapper/mods/{integration,utils}
dapper/tools/linalg,rounding}

fixed issue with node clicks"
;

